Package: tampaBayOpenData
Title: An R Interface to Tampa Bay Public Open Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jaclenga", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "jack3lenga@gmail.com")
Description: Discover, inspect, and retrieve authoritative public datasets
    through a small catalog-driven interface. The initial release supports
    City of Tampa ArcGIS feature and map services, with verified dataset
    metadata, checked pagination, server-side filtering, typed tabular
    results, optional spatial objects, and attached source provenance.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.2.3),
    jsonlite (>= 1.6.0),
    tibble
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    sf (>= 1.0.0),
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
